█                                  Update List    			         		       █
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████

UPDATED S10:
- Added S10 weapons
- New very aggressive aim assist “HACK AIM”
- Speedtoggle added for rapid fire (possibility to quickly enable/disable rapid fire by pressing 2 buttons)
- Added the ability to enable/disable release aim, strafe, dropshot, and auto aim for each profile (primary/secondary)
- Mod edit bug fixed: exiting did not show the rotating text
- Progressive bug: horizontal time anti-recoil value was not displayed
- Auto loot bug: did not disable on all profiles
- Small general bug fixes

UPDATED S11:
- Added new weapons
- Test code added for weapon setup (a code made exclusively for setting weapons)
- Added new 100% laser anti-recoil
- Stick reset active by default
- Hack aim replaced with new aim assist (very good in my opinion)
- No-scope anti-recoil value for each weapon
- In progressive anti-recoil, added mid value for vertical and horizontal
- Weapon reset button for when you finish a game
- Easier to find weapons in the menu
- Added Superglide
- Option to choose between medium and fast auto loot
- Option to choose language between English and Italian
- Loading screen changed
- Removed rapid fire weapons category

UPDATED S12:
- Fixed S12 weapons
- Adjust sensitivity via code
- Adjustable hack aim value
- Crunch shot only in hipfire / only in ADS / always
- Strafe shot only in hipfire / only in ADS / always
- Option to change button for auto loot / superglide
- Option to add/remove weapons
- Fixed left analog aim assist

UPDATED S13:
- Fixed S13 weapons
- New mod: Fast Heal
- Removed Cancel Slide and replaced with Hide Weapons
- Changed Sweet Evil
- Small bug fixes with new firmware

UPDATED S14:
- Anti-recoil completely reworked
- Easier weapon selection
- Barrel added to weapon selection
- Button configuration selection on display with inverted option added
- Hack aim renamed to Accuracy
- Aim Assist General added
- Aim assist names and order changed
- Increase/decrease sensitivity on display
- Customizable mod values in auto aim, release aim, dropshot, strafe
- Removed speed toggle
- Customizable loot time on display
- On-display explanations for modifiable values
- Superglide easier to use and now works on all object heights
- Fixed S14 weapons
- Fixed saves
- New intro
- Jump Zipl added to Down button: performs a super jump on zipline
- Screensaver now shows weapon name

UPDATED S15:
- Edit vert and edit horiz simplified for anti-recoil adjustment (now percentage-based)
- Aim assist bug fixed
- x4 scope
- AR no-scope value
- Auto loot mod added: jump or crouch while taking shield (works only if you use non-default jump/crouch buttons)
- Custom primary/secondary weapon buttons and weapon reset
- Speed toggle
- Superglide bug fixed for some
- Sens X and Sens Y changed to Hyp Sens X and Hyp Sens Y (now only changes sensitivity in hipfire)
- Changed anti-recoil for R-99 and L-STAR

UPDATED S16:
- New mod Crouchspam: holding crouch will make you stand/crouch repeatedly (reaction time and speed adjustable)
- New mod Press L3: same as Press Down but works on L3
- Added cursor speed bar in auto loot time setting (simplifies setup)
- New weapon Nemesis
- New mod Spam Execution: holding Down or L3 will keep executing
- Hemlok and R-99 anti-recoil fixed
- Anti-recoil weapon values clearly visible in code
- Bug fix: weapon swap triggered when double pressing change weapon
- Bug fix: black screen when pressing changeweapon4 and changeweapon5
- Removed Auto Run

UPDATED S17:
- Ability to change anti-recoil per weapon (vertical, horizontal, hipfire vertical, hipfire horizontal)
- Ability to change anti-recoil per scope
- Mantle jump added to Press Down, Press L3, and Press Left mods
- Auto aim timing increased (will aim once instead of spamming)
- Mods can be enabled per weapon
- Mod values per weapon
- Auto weapon swap when mag is empty (Keep Firing) (choose hipfire only or always)
- Added option to disable controller vibration
- (BETA) Weapons AI: after selecting primary and secondary, Cronus detects the weapon you’re firing
- Classic Bunnyhop changed: in-game press jump + crouch to activate (works only with hold crouch)
- Favorite weapons set (max 5): assign primary and secondary with attachments using 2 controller buttons
- Added side Superglide
- S17 intro
- New mod Loot Spam (holding will spam interact)
- Removed toggles
- Ability to select buttons for each mod
- Loot Auto renamed to Armor Swap
- Sensivity renamed to Settings
- Ability to select 3 weapons for new character (Ballistics)
- New mod Press Left: same as Press Down and Press L3 (must disable survival slot button in-game) (holding left d-pad sets single-fire mode)
- Removed AR no-scope (now in mod settings)
- Bug fix: when downed, could not raise knockdown shield due to rapid fire
- Bug fix: when downed, knockdown shield lowered due to anti-recoil
- Bug fix: grenade throw pulling view down due to anti-recoil
- Bug fix: using mod on Down or L3 still triggered default Down/L3 action
- Bug fix: AR no-scope value or button not saving

UPDATED S18:
- Changed Bunnyhop for toggle and added Bunnyhop Fast
- New mod: Fast Reload (reloads faster — only with purple mag)
- New anti-recoil
- New mod Alc Sens: choose normal or ALC sensitivity
- Added Havoc and Devotion Turbo
- Improved default anti-recoil: SMG anti-recoil now increases automatically
- Inspect animations: Hands and Heirloom
- Bug fix: Inspect mod screen shake
- Bug fix: intro interruption
- Added option to choose buttons for menus, mods, and reset

UPDATED S19:
- Bug fix: Wall Jump
- New mod Grapple Jump: jumps when using grapple (Pathfinder) (ONLY WITH RUMBLE)
- New mod Jump Spam: spams jump when holding jump button
- Improved Bunnyhop Hold
- New mod Armor Box: changes armor every time you open a box
- Quick weapon swap with 2 buttons
- Auto-save: no need to press ping to save
- Bug fix: LED did not flash with some weapons with rapid fire active
- Improved L-STAR anti-recoil
- Improved Hemlok anti-recoil
- Auto-detection for L-STAR (with AI Weapon mod)
- Edit vert, edit horiz, and edit hyp adjustable per weapon from display
- Reduced accidental weapon swaps

UPDATED S20:
- Rapid fire, auto aim, crouch shot, strafe shot, and release aim can now be enabled for each weapon directly from the display
- Inactivity timeout: 30 minutes (disconnects the controller and switches to slot 0)
- Zen delay halved (default Zen delay is 10 ms, now reduced to 5 ms with the script)
- Barrel and optic are now visible in the display menu
- x4 optic recognition (when selecting the x4 optic on the display, you can automatically switch from x2 to x4 in-game without changing it from the display)
- Ability to change barrel values from the script
- 4 new variants for Armor Swap and Armor Box (Toxic, Inspect, Spam Jump, Spam Crouch)
- Keep Firing bug fixed for some weapons (now works for all weapons)
- Fixed bug where exiting a mod value would scroll too far back
- Stick drift can now go down to 1
- Character selection on display (currently only useful for Pathfinder and Ballistic)
- Removed Sweetevil
- Added 5 Quick Weapons and 3 Loadouts
- Option to set Superglide on the Ping button
- Option to assign Bunnyhop to a button (hold Bunnyhop only)
- You can now keep using the Press Down mod and select in-game upgrades (by pressing aim)
- You can now change 1x/2x and 2x/4x optics even if you have a mod on L3
- You can now change fire mode even if you are using the Inspect mod (by pressing aim)
- Quick selection for barrel and optics via button combination
- Anti-recoil fix: R-99, Prowler, Hemlok
- Moved Grapple Path and 3 Weapons mods — now they activate automatically when you select the character
- Added Vibration Game option in mod settings
- Added Aim Y and Aim X sensitivity in mod settings
- Option to change the first button used to open menus

UPDATED S21:
- New mod: Weapon Detection — detects the weapon when “default” is shown on the display (if it detects a weapon that needs rapid fire, it will auto-enable it) (does not work with Rampage)
- AI Weapon Detection: completely reworked, now detects ~90% more accurately than before (does not work with Rampage)
- Ability to adjust anti-recoil for each weapon with all optics via display
- Zen delay returns to 10 ms for those using controller vibration (remains at 5 ms without vibration)
- Removed loadouts to save space in the script
- Completely redesigned main screen
- 2-Touch: Quick Weapons, Quick Scope, and Quick Barrel simplified — now you just select one button combo for everything
- Anti-recoil improved for Hemlok, Nemesis, CAR
- Bug fix: 2x/4x optic now changes with aim button instead of menu button
- Bug fix: Superglide at 120 FPS slightly improved
- Bug fix: Quick Weapons no longer detects the second button press in-game
- If you put away a grenade while about to throw it, it will no longer swap weapons
- Vantage: no more weapon swapping when using ultimate
- Mirage: no more weapon swapping after revive
- Ash: firing in hipfire will auto-use tactical
- Ballistic: firing in hipfire will auto-use tactical
- Armor Box: cursor is now much more precise
- Added Superglide to the jump button (hold in-game only)

UPDATED S22:
- New mod: Target — choose whether to have anti-recoil tuned for walls or enemies
- Superglide 60/120 FPS: choose between 60 FPS or 120 FPS from the screen
- Superglide 120 FPS now works as perfectly as 60 FPS
- Removed Accuracy mod to free up space
- Weapon Detection works perfectly on PS5 and PC with PS5 controller
- AI Weapons now in two types: Normal (works only with one AR and one SMG) and Super (works with 2 ARs or 2 SMGs — PS5/PC with PS5 controller only)
- Jump Zipl added to Easy Mod — in-game just press interact + jump quickly
- Superglide added to Easy Mod
- Inspect and Toxic mods added to Superglide
- Reset only primary or secondary weapon (2-Touch)
- Bug fix: Aim Assist stuttering with high values
- Bug fix: Superglide on jump button no longer exits death boxes
- Bug fix: selecting Mirage on the display no longer gets stuck on primary/secondary

UPDATED S23:
- Added Detect Weapon Always: always detects weapons (Normal only detects when “default” is on the display)
- 2-Touch added to mod menu — select buttons for 2-Touch directly from display
- Button selection directly from display — first time running the script, it will ask for your in-game button layout
- Quick Weapons, Release Aim, and Loadouts removed to save space
- Completely changed Jump Zipl in Easy Mod — now always works and doesn’t conflict with other in-game actions (requires vibration)
- Vibration rules: if Rumble Game is off, some mods cannot be enabled
- Improved AI Weapons for both types
- Renamed AI Weapons Super to “PS5”
- Menu button changes: D-pad Up/Down changes values by 1, Aim + D-pad Up/Down changes by 10, D-pad Left/Right switches between mods
- Bug fix: Weapon Detection — Mastiff, Peacekeeper, EVA-8, Mozambique, Wingman, Longbow, Sentinel no longer trigger false detections
- Anti-recoil improved for R-99 and R-301
- Removed Havoc Turbo and Devotion Turbo
- Inspect: added Speed value to adjust animation speed

UPDATED S24:
- Rumble Game now OFF by default — turns ON automatically when vibration is detected
- AI Weapons Normal improved — now works perfectly on Xbox as well
- Default SMG setting now also works on Xbox
- On Xbox, enabling Weapon Detection will only detect L-STAR
- Fixed minor visual bugs caused by 2-Touch
- Improved Weapon Detection — now detects reliably at all times
- Improved Toxic for Superglide, Armor Swap, and Armor Box mods
- Armor Box now activates only if you open a box and press Ping
- Armor Swap made faster, more reliable, and precise
- Bug fix: Nemesis Charged and CAR were not detected by Weapon Detection or AI Weapons PS5
- Improved Mantle Jump (more reliable)
- Improved Jump Zipl (faster)
- Bug fix: using 2-Touch was triggering mods on press L3 / press Down / press Left
- In Edit Vert, Edit Horiz, Edit Resp, and Edit Hyp mods you can now aim and shoot while setting up a weapon without exiting the mod menu

UPDATED S25:
- Enemy mod improved — now more accurate for all weapons
- Zen delay reduced from 8 ms to 5 ms (less input lag). With Game Rumble OFF it drops from 5 ms to 4 ms
- Charged Rampage now detected by Weapon Detection and AI Weapons
- Added Heal Armor Box inside Armor Box — heal while inside the box
- Reset buttons directly from display (inside Mod Settings)
- Controller vibration toggle added in Pad Rumble mod (inside Mod Settings)
- Changed Armor Time bar animation
- Swap Primary/Sec added to initial button setup
- Now possible to use L1/R1 to aim and shoot (contact me for setup)
- Superglide on jump button greatly improved (no vibration required)
- Changed button for weapon reset and sub-mod change — default is now Square instead of Touchpad (can be changed in script)
- Reorganized some mods
- Renamed some mods
- Removed Bunnyhop Fast
- Removed Aim Sens and Hyp Sens
- Bug fix: Superglide on Ping button no longer blocks ultimate ability
- Bug fix: 2-Touch now shows correct buttons for Xbox users

UPDATED S26:
- Initial button configuration changed. Now includes options: Default, Evolved, Ninja, Custom, and Custom PS5.
With the Custom PS5 layout, you can use any button setup and still use the Auto Detect mod.
(The script will automatically remap buttons, just like on Beam 2.0.)
- Initial setup updated. You can now select your sensitivity directly.
- Zen delay reduced to 4ms (previously 5ms).
- Aim Assist completely reworked: now works correctly across all sensitivity types. when you select your sensitivity, the aim assist adjusts automatically.
- Auto Detect is now much faster at recognizing weapons. (In S25 it needed 2–5 bullets, in S26 only 1–2 bullets are enough. )
- Auto Detect is much more reliable 
- Auto Resync PS5 is faster at swapping weapons on the display.
- Auto Detect will now remember the attachments of your last 3 used weapons. (Useful for Ballistic, Vantage, and in case of false detections)
- Stick Drift Mod now shows your analog stick values,so you can better understand what value to use.
- Stick Drift Mod now correctly removes drift even on Linear No Deadzone.
- Error warning messages added on display if something is set up incorrectly.
- New "Edit Scope" mod. Adjust anti-recoil for all optics together.
- Anti-recoil improved for: R301, R99,RE45 and Flatline. Also improved little bit for all the other weapons.
- New Mod Target option: "Enemy only SMG"(SMGs will use Enemy mode, other weapons will use a more aggressive Wall mode).
- Superglide improved. Now much more consistent.
- Armor Swap improved. Now picks up the shield even when moving analogs at max speed.
- Hidden menu closing. Closing the weapon/mod menu will no longer trigger aiming in-game.
- Weapon reset behavior changed for 2-touch mod. Double press on the second button resets both primary and secondary. Single press resets only the weapon shown on screen.
- Auto Detect and Auto Resync now activate automatically as soon as trigger vibration is detected (like Game Rumble).
- P2020 removed and replaced with NONE RF (no anti-recoil, but with rapidfire).
- Fast reload mod improved
- Keep firing mod improved
- Fast Heal removed
- Sticky Fire removed
- Bug fixed: When downed, the shield was being spammed (only on PS5/PC with Auto Detect mod active).
- Bug fixed: Adaptive triggers were active with Pad Rumble mod (now correctly silenced).
- Bug fixed: Selecting Ash on the display triggered random tactical throws. Now it only happens in hipfire.
- Bug fixed: Aim assist values now save correctly even when set to 0.

UPDATED S26 (Patch 0.1):
- Bug fixed: "Customized ps5" option was bugged: it didn’t let you use certain mods and prevented some buttons from being pressed simultaneously.
- Removed Mirage and Vantage.

UPDATED S26 (Patch 0.2):
- Bug fixed: The "Customized PS5" option was bugged: it either prevented you from switching between mods or from using the 2-touch mod with certain buttons.

UPDATED S26 (Patch 0.3):
- New antirecoil RE-45
- Slightly adjusted aim assist for classic sensitivity
- Default auto aim value changed
- Superglide 165 FPS added under the time option

UPDATED S26 (Patch 0.4):
- New horizontal anti-recoil for R301
- Bug fixed: wall jump will no longer trigger by mistake
- Bug fixed: graphical glitches on refresh when using the 2-touch mod
- Bug fixed: small anti-recoil issue

UPDATED S27:
- Auto Resync mod now includes 3 options:
     PS4: The old normal mode, but improved, it will confuse weapons much less often.
     PS5: Optimized for weapons with rapidfire.
     Xbox: Similar to the old normal mode, but greatly improved for Xbox. There will no longer be false detections when getting shot, jumping, or crouching.
- New Weapon Added: Alternator D.
- New Mod Fast Perk: Instantly selects the perk when pressing the mod button.
- Superglide Rework: You now only need to hold the jump button to mantle, and release the jump button to perform a superglide.
- StrafeShot Rework: now works only when the left stick is not being touched.
- Stick Drift Mod now properly removes drift even on Linear No Deadzone.
- Auto Detect will now remember the attachments of your last 4 used weapons (it was 3).
- Rapidfire can now be enabled/disabled only for single-shot weapons (too many users were mistakenly enabling it for all weapons).
- Aim Assist (General) no longer appears for players using Linear response curve.
- Bug Fixed: Jump zipline wasn’t always working.
- Minor bug fixes.

UPDATED S28:
- Antirecoil: slightly changed the antirecoil of the Re45, Devotion, Devotion Turbo, Spitfire and also slightly adjusted other weapons
- Fixed aim assist behavior, which was not working correctly for some players
- Auto detect mod:
  - One of the biggest issues with the auto detect mod was accessory selection. Many players would fire 1 shot to get the weapon recognized and then select the accessories, which was very inconvenient.
    We made accessory selection MUCH simpler:
    now you can select optic and barrel directly on the default weapon, as soon as you shoot the zen recognizes the weapon and automatically applies the optic and barrel. (works only with assault rifles)
  - Memorizes the last 4 weapons only if they have an accessory selected (previously it memorized any weapon)
- New password system: after choosing the sensitivity a password will be required. Find everything here scriptcronus.it/verify
- 2 touch mod: you no longer need to press twice to reset both weapons, just press once.
- New feature for PS5: pressing right arrow removes the script to make bypass easier (only during the intro)
- New Fire Limit mod: reduces sensitivity when shooting (only in hipfire or always). Option to choose the percentage
- Armor Swap mod improved
- Zipl Jump mod improved
- Keep firing removed
- Edit resp removed from mod settings
- Superglide renamed to mantle boost
- Renamed other mods
- Bug fix: values were occasionally not being saved
- Minor bug fixes


